articles.content_en:
The Standing Committee of the National People's Congress discussed the issue of the meaning of "misappropriation of public funds for personal use" by a state functionary who, by taking advantage of his office, misappropriates public funds as provided in paragraph 1 of Article 384 of the Criminal Law, and gives the following interpretation:
Under any of the following circumstances, it shall be deemed as misappropriation of public funds for personal use:
(1) providing public funds to oneself, relatives, friends, or other natural persons for use;
(2) providing public funds to another unit in one's own name;
(3) individually deciding to provide public funds to another unit in the name of the unit, for the purpose of seeking personal benefits.
The above is hereby announced.
